+								D3DPBLENDCAPS_INVSRCALPHA |		// Blend factor is (1-As, 1-As, 1-As, 1-As).
+								D3DPBLENDCAPS_INVSRCCOLOR |		// Blend factor is (1-Rs, 1-Gs, 1-Bs, 1-As).
